                                   🔲 FILTER
Filter is a server-side component that intercepts HTTP requests and responses before they reach the Servlet (DispatcherServlet) and after the response is generated.

                      ( Client / Browser )
                               |
                               v
                     ......................
                     .   Embedded Server  .
                     .   (Tomcat/Jetty)   .
                     ......................
                               |
                               v
                     ......................
                     .      Servlet API   .
                     . (HttpServlet etc.)  .
                     ......................
                               |
                               v
                     ......................
                     .   DispatcherServlet .
                     ......................
                               |
                               v
                     ......................
                     .  HandlerInterceptor .
                     .  ------------------  .
                     .  preHandle()        .
                     .  postHandle()       .
                     .  afterCompletion()  .
                     ......................
                               |
                               v
                     ......................
                     .      Controllers    .
                     .  ------------------  .
                     .  HomeController     .
                     .  ApplicantController.
                     .  Controller3        .
                     ......................

 🔲⛓️ Filter Chain :

     ( Client / Browser )
              |
              v
    ......................
    .   Embedded Server  .
    .   (Tomcat/Jetty)   .
    ......................
              |
              v
    ......................
    .     Filter Chain    .
    .  ------------------  .
    .  Filter 1           .
    .  (LoggingFilter)    .
    ......................
              |
              v
    ......................
    .  Filter 2           .
    .  (AuthFilter)       .
    ......................
              |
              v
    ......................
    .  Filter 3           .
    .  (CORSFilter)       .
    ......................
              |
              v
    ......................
    .   DispatcherServlet .
    ......................
              |
              v
    ......................
    .     Controllers     .
    ......................
              |
              v
         ( Response )

🔥 Execution Flow (Very Important) :
                           - Request aata hai
                           - Embedded Server receive karta hai
                           - Filter 1 → Filter 2 → Filter 3 (order wise execute hote hain)
                           - Fir DispatcherServlet ko pass hota hai
                           - Controller execute hota hai
                           - Response wapas reverse order me filters se pass hota hai
                               👉 Response aate time:
                                                  - Filter 3
                                                  - Filter 2
                                                  - Filter 1